{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07660","headline":"行路难五首 五 · 贺兰进明","name":"行路难五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见东流水，一去无穷已。\n君不见西郊云，日夕空氛氲。\n羣鴈裴回不能去，一鴈悲鸣复失羣。\n人生结交在终始，莫以升沈中路分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺兰进明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07660.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07660","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}